			{itemID=198058,diffs={2},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=24776,title="Overview",body="Chrono-Lord Deios begins the fight with 100 temporal energy and uses it to create |cFF2959D3|Hspell:376319|h[Eternity Orbs]|h|r to destroy players and drain their time. \n\nUpon reaching 0 energy, Deios casts |cFF2959D3|Hspell:376209|h[Rewind Timeflow]|h|r to recharge his energy. While time is being reversed, |cFF2959D3|Hspell:376333|h[Temporal Zone]|h|r return time energy back to players within them."},
			{id=24777,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:376325|h[Eternity Zone]|h|r inflicts damage and absorbs the time of players within, reducing their haste.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:376333|h[Temporal Zone]|h|r returns lost time to players within, massively increasing their haste."},
			{id=24778,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:376325|h[Eternity Zone]|h|r inflicts damage and absorbs the time of players within, reducing their haste.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:376333|h[Temporal Zone]|h|r returns lost time to players within, massively increasing their haste."},
			{id=24779,title="Healers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:376209|h[Rewind Timeflow]|h|r inflicts high damage to all players over its duration.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:376325|h[Eternity Zone]|h|r inflicts damage and absorbs the time of players within, reducing their haste.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:376333|h[Temporal Zone]|h|r returns lost time to players within, massively increasing their haste."},
			{id=24795,title="Eternity's Ebb and Flow"},
