			{itemID=200419,diffs={17,14,15,16},faction=-1},
			{itemID=200428,diffs={17,14,15,16},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=25115,title="Overview",body="Broodkeeper Diurna gains storm energy as the battle ensues, defending the Primalist Clutch with primal elements and calling upon Primalist Reinforcements. At 100 storm energy she casts |cFF2959D3|Hspell:376073|h[Rapid Incubation]|h|r on the Primalist eggs, expediting the growth of the dragon inside. Players incurring |cFF2959D3|Hspell:390710|h[Greatstaff's Wrath]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:390711|h[Empowered Greatstaff's Wrath]|h|r can break these eggs, else lieutenants from each Primal element's eggs join the battle.\n\nUpon gaining |cFF2959D3|Hspell:375879|h[Broodkeeper's Fury]|h|r, Diurna lashes out harnessing the primal elements with enhanced skill."},
			{id=25116,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:376073|h[Rapid Incubation]|h|r marks future egg targets as Diurna moves about The Clutchwarren.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:375870|h[Mortal Stoneclaws]|h|r inflicts high damage and reduces healing recieved, and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:375879|h[Broodkeeper's Fury]|h|r increases the duration of the healing reduction.\n$bullet;Primalist Reinforcements should be engaged quickly as to prevent them from healing, increasing damage done, and reducing damage taken from Diurna's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:375809|h[Broodkeeper's Bond]|h|r.",difficultyIDs={14,15,17}},
			{id=26123,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:376073|h[Rapid Incubation]|h|r marks future egg targets as Diurna moves about The Clutchwarren.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:375870|h[Mortal Stoneclaws]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:396269|h[Mortal Stoneslam]|h|r inflict high damage and reduce healing recieved.\n$bullet;Primalist Reinforcements should be engaged quickly as to prevent them from healing, increasing damage done, and reducing damage taken from Diurna's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:375809|h[Broodkeeper's Bond]|h|r.",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=25117,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Utilize |cFF2959D3|Hspell:390710|h[Greatstaff's Wrath]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:390711|h[Empowered Greatstaff's Wrath]|h|r to break eggs targeted by Diurna's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:376073|h[Rapid Incubation]|h|r.\n$bullet;Primalist Mages can inflict high damage with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:375716|h[Ice Barrage]|h|r when left uncontrolled.\n$bullet;Prior to Diurna gaining |cFF2959D3|Hspell:375879|h[Broodkeeper's Fury]|h|r, players within |cFF2959D3|Hspell:390561|h[Diurna's Gaze]|h|r take increased damage."},
			{id=25118,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Utilize |cFF2959D3|Hspell:390710|h[Greatstaff's Wrath]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:390711|h[Empowered Greatstaff's Wrath]|h|r to break eggs targeted by Diurna's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:376073|h[Rapid Incubation]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:388716|h[Icy Shroud]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:388918|h[Frozen Shroud]|h|r absorb incoming healing, snaring or rooting the afflicted player.\n$bullet;Prior to Diurna gaining |cFF2959D3|Hspell:375879|h[Broodkeeper's Fury]|h|r, players within |cFF2959D3|Hspell:390561|h[Diurna's Gaze]|h|r take increased damage."},
			{id=25119,title="Stage One: The Primalist Clutch"},
