		},
		sections={
			{id=25361,title="Overview",body="Kyrakka begins the battle airborne, breathing flames and spitting fire from around the Ruby Overlook, whilst Erkhart intercepts players directly.\n\nUpon either of them reaching $398295s1% health, Kyrakka lands so Erkhart can remount, battling players atop Kyrakka."},
			{id=25362,title="Tank",body="$bullet; Erkhart's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:381512|h[Stormslam]|h|r inflicts high damage.\n$bullet; Kyrakka's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:381607|h[Inferno Spit]|h|r denies space with resultant |cFF2959D3|Hspell:384773|h[Flaming Embers]|h|r.\n$bullet; Erkhart's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:381517|h[Winds of Change]|h|r push players and Kyrakka's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:384773|h[Flaming Embers]|h|r."},
			{id=25363,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; Kyrakka's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:381607|h[Inferno Spit]|h|r denies space with resultant |cFF2959D3|Hspell:384773|h[Flaming Embers]|h|r.\n$bullet; Erkhart's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:381517|h[Winds of Change]|h|r push players and Kyrakka's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:384773|h[Flaming Embers]|h|r.\n$bullet; Erkhart's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:381516|h[Interrupting Cloudburst]|h|r interrupts casts."},
			{id=25364,title="Healer",body="$bullet; Kyrakka's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:381607|h[Inferno Spit]|h|r inflicts significant damage to players.\n$bullet; Erkhart's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:381516|h[Interrupting Cloudburst]|h|r interrupts casts.\n$bullet; Erkhart's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:381517|h[Winds of Change]|h|r push players and Kyrakka's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:384773|h[Flaming Embers]|h|r."},
