			{itemID=205145,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=26173,title="Overview",body="As combat unfolds, Kazzara tears open |cFF2959D3|Hspell:407196|h[Dread Rifts]|h|r from which |cFF2959D3|Hspell:407069|h[Rays of Anguish]|h|r will form to hunt players. At $401319s3%, $401319s4%, and $401319s5% health remaining, plates of Kazzara's menacing armor are shattered off during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:401319|h[Hellsteel Carnage]|h|r, intensifying her |cFF2959D3|Hspell:408367|h[Infernal Heart]|h|r."},
			{id=26174,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:404744|h[Terror Claws]|h|r inflict heavy damage and increase damage taken from further casts.\n$bullet;Upon reaching 100 energy, |cFF2959D3|Hspell:400430|h[Hellbeam]|h|r is unleashed inflicting massive damage to anyone caught in the effect."},
			{id=26709,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:407069|h[Rays of Anguish]|h|r hunt players and leave behind a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:402421|h[Molten Scar]|h|r.\n$bullet;Upon reaching 100 energy, |cFF2959D3|Hspell:400430|h[Hellbeam]|h|r is unleashed inflicting massive damage to anyone caught in the effect.",difficultyIDs={14,17}},
			{id=26711,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:407069|h[Rays of Anguish]|h|r hunt players and leave behind a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:402421|h[Molten Scar]|h|r until they are consumed by a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:407046|h[Dread Rift]|h|r.\n$bullet;Upon reaching 100 energy, |cFF2959D3|Hspell:400430|h[Hellbeam]|h|r is unleashed inflicting massive damage to anyone caught in the effect.",difficultyIDs={15}},
			{id=26175,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:407069|h[Rays of Anguish]|h|r hunt players and leave behind a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:402421|h[Molten Scar]|h|r until they are consumed by a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:407046|h[Dread Rift]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:407069|h[Rays of Anguish]|h|r crossing onto an existing |cFF2959D3|Hspell:402421|h[Molten Scar]|h|r cause |cFF2959D3|Hspell:408147|h[Infernal Fusion]|h|r.\n$bullet;Upon reaching 100 energy, |cFF2959D3|Hspell:400430|h[Hellbeam]|h|r is unleashed inflicting massive damage to anyone caught in the effect.",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=26710,title="Healers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:407069|h[Rays of Anguish]|h|r hunt players and leave behind a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:402421|h[Molten Scar]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:403326|h[Wings of Extinction]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:408367|h[Infernal Heart]|h|r inflict heavy raidwide damage.",difficultyIDs={14,17}},
