		order=3,
		name="The Forgotten Experiments",
		lore="The development of the dracthyr produced many iterations, some more successful than others. Early versions of the experiment proved far too volatile to destroy. Kept dormant for thousands of years, these creations have now awakened, and seek to test their prowess against the champions of Azeroth.",
		dungeonEncounterID=2693,
