			{id=27865,title="Ashen Treant",body="Ashen Treants erupt with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:418535|h[Explosive Bark]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:417610|h[Burning Ground]|h|r when killed.\n\n$[!15 On Heroic and Mythic difficulties, Ashen Treants leave behind a trail of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:417610|h[Burning Ground]|h|r.$]$[!16 On Heroic and Mythic difficulties, Ashen Treants create a trail of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:417610|h[Burning Ground]|h|r.$]",difficultyIDs={15,16}},
