		sections={
			{id=27268,title="Overview",body="Igira unleashes |cFF2959D3|Hspell:414425|h[Blistering Spears]|h|r to restrict how far her victims can flee. At 100 energy, Igira uses |cFF2959D3|Hspell:422776|h[Marked for Torment]|h|r to ignite areas in her chamber, tormenting players standing within them. Based on the ignited area players stand within, Igira changes her weapon and gains new abilities.\n$[!16\nOn Mythic difficulty, Igira forges two weapons at once during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:422776|h[Marked for Torment]|h|r.$]"},
			{id=27269,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;While a player is tethered to a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:414425|h[Blistering Spear]|h|r their movement is restricted."},
